@startuml
title Agent Orchestrator Desktop - Engine Selection & Retry Flow

actor User
participant "ConsoleView (React)" as UI
participant "IPC Handlers (electron/ipc/)" as IPC
participant "RunOrchestrator (Worker)" as RO
participant "WorkflowEngine (Worker)" as WE
participant "RunStore (SQLite)" as RS
participant "EngineAdapter Factory" as Factory
participant "Engine Adapter" as Adapter

== Engine Selection (New Run) ==
User -> UI: Select Engine (Codex/Gemini Phase 1-4 | OpenCode/ClaudeCode Phase 5)
User -> UI: Input Prompt & Execute
UI -> IPC: ipcRenderer.invoke('run:agent', { engine, prompt })
IPC -> IPC: Validate input (type, length, allowed command)
IPC -> RO: postMessage({ type: 'execute', engine, prompt })
RO -> RS: create_run(engine, status='queued')
RO -> Factory: get_adapter(engine)
Factory -> Adapter: Initialize
RO -> Adapter: execute_run(prompt)
Adapter -> Adapter: child_process.spawn(engine, args, { shell: false })
Adapter --> RO: stdout/stderr stream
RO --> IPC: postMessage({ type: 'progress', data })
IPC --> UI: ipcRenderer.on('run:progress', cb)

== Engine-Aware Retry Flow ==
User -> UI: Click Retry (Current UI Engine: Gemini)
UI -> IPC: ipcRenderer.invoke('run:retry', { runId, engine: 'gemini' })
IPC -> RO: retry_run(runId, engine='gemini')
RO -> RS: get_run(runId)
RS --> RO: Original Record (e.g., engine='codex')
RO -> RO: create_run(newId, engine='gemini')
note right: UI's current engine selection\noverrides original record
RO -> RS: create_run(newId, engine='gemini')
RO -> Factory: get_adapter('gemini')
RO -> Adapter: execute_run(prompt)

== Workflow Step Retry ==
User -> UI: Click Retry from Step (UI Engine: Gemini)
UI -> IPC: ipcRenderer.invoke('workflow:retry-step', { runId, stepId, engine: 'gemini' })
IPC -> WE: retry_workflow_run_from_step(engine='gemini')
WE -> WE: _restart_workflow_from_existing_run(engine='gemini')
WE -> WE: create_workflow_run(engine='gemini')
WE -> RO: execute_step_run(prompt)
RO -> Adapter: execute_run(prompt)

note over Factory
  ALLOWED_COMMANDS:
  Phase 1-4: codex, gemini
  Phase 5:    + opencode, claudecode
end note

@enduml
